GROWTH STRATEGY & MARKET EXPANSION

Year 1-2: Foundation Building
• BCCS142 market penetration: 40-100 Part 142 customers
• BCCSMaint pilot programs: 25-50 fleet operators
• Platform integration and optimization

Year 3: Acceleration Phase
• International expansion (EASA, Transport Canada)
• Aircraft Registry tokenization launch
• Cross-platform synergies implementation

Year 4: Market Leadership
• Ecosystem network effects activated
• Major airline partnerships established
• Universal regulatory framework deployment

Year 5: Category Dominance
• Global market leadership achieved
• Multiple acquisition opportunities
• IPO readiness or strategic exit

