RISK FACTORS & MITIGATION

Market Risks
• Regulatory approval delays: Diversified platform approach reduces single-point risk
• Economic downturn: Essential compliance needs remain recession-resistant
• Competition: Patent protection and first-mover advantage

Financial Risks
• Cash flow timing: Conservative revenue projections with 20% buffer
• Customer concentration: Diversified customer base across multiple platforms
• Technology costs: Scalable cloud infrastructure with predictable pricing

Operational Risks
• Talent acquisition: Staff-on-Demand model provides flexibility
• Technology scaling: Proven architecture with demonstrated scalability
• Regulatory compliance: Deep expertise and automated monitoring

